msgid ""
"Lynbro builds genuinely free, privacy-first WordPress plugins with generous "
"free cores — no credits, no paywalls on the essentials, your data on your "
"own site. Made in Denmark."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro loob tõeliselt tasuta, privaatsust esikohale seadvaid WordPressi "
"pluginaid helde tasuta põhiga — pole krediite, pole oluliste funktsioonide "
"tasuseinu, sinu andmed sinu saidil. Valmistatud Taanis."

msgid "Suggest a feature or report a bug"
msgstr "Paku funktsiooni või anna veast teada"

msgid ""
"Feedback opens our public roadmap on plugins.lynbro.dk in a new tab — "
"nothing is sent from your site."
msgstr ""
"Tagasiside avab meie avaliku teekaardi aadressil plugins.lynbro.dk uues "
"vahekaardis — sinu saidilt midagi ei saadeta."

msgid ""
"Shared Lynbro components v%1$s, provided by %2$s (newest of %3$d versions on"
" this site)."
msgstr ""
"Jagatud Lynbro komponendid v%1$s, pakub %2$s (uusim %3$d versioonist sellel "
"saidil)."

