msgstr "Kas %s teeb oma tööd?"

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you, a short "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it — honest ones, "
"critical ones included."
msgstr ""
"Oled seda kasutanud juba paar nädalat. Kui see töötab sinu jaoks, aitab "
"lühike arvustus WordPress.org-is ka teistel saidiomanikel seda leida — ausad"
" ja kriitilised arvustused on oodatud."

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you — or if "
"something is missing — tell us on our public roadmap. That is how we decide "
"what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Oled seda kasutanud juba paar nädalat. Kui see töötab sinu jaoks — või kui "
"midagi on puudu — anna teada meie avalikul teekaardil. Nii otsustame, mida "
"järgmisena arendada."

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(avaneb uues vahekaardis)"

msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Jaga tagasisidet"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "Võib-olla hiljem"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Ära küsi enam"

msgid "Something not working? Ask for help"
msgstr "Midagi ei tööta? Küsi abi"

