msgstr "Soovitatud sellele saidile"

msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Peida soovitused"

msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Teised Lynbro pluginad, mis sobivad selle saidi kasutusega. Midagi ei "
"paigaldata enne, kui klõpsad."

msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Kõik Lynbro pluginad"

msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Valitud selle saidi juba kasutatavate põhjal — loetakse ainult sellel "
"saidil, midagi ei saadeta mujale."

msgid ""
"Export this plugin&#8217;s settings as a JSON backup, or reset them to "
"defaults. 100% local — nothing leaves your site."
msgstr ""
"Ekspordi selle plugina seaded JSON-varukoopiana või taasta vaikeseaded. 100%"
" kohalik — midagi ei lahku sinu saidilt."

